From 8da9b2a0e60a209ec497d3c8bd1e1664b1ef53c8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yang Tsao <yang@fydeos.io>
Date: Fri, 12 Jun 2026 17:51:09 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 21/40] SF: expose WM window type as ARC generic metadata
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Add org.chromium.arc.V1_0.WindowType -> METADATA_WINDOW_TYPE to the generic
layer-metadata key map so the window type WindowManager stamps on every
SurfaceControl reaches the composer. On AOSP-13 HWC2::setLayerInfo (which used
to carry window-type classification) was removed; the fydroid composer needs
the type to classify standalone (no-TaskId) layers — TYPE_TOAST/IME/OVERLAY —
and give them a zcr_toast_surface. CompositionEngineArc reads it from the
layer composition-state metadata; WaylandHwc2Composer advertises the key.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Change-Id: I5bb12273127b7fbdc4c4e2bd850b2947d48fb932
---
 services/surfaceflinger/SurfaceFlinger.cpp | 5 +++++
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/services/surfaceflinger/SurfaceFlinger.cpp b/services/surfaceflinger/SurfaceFlinger.cpp
index 619c4aeaeb..c6237c4be9 100644
--- a/services/surfaceflinger/SurfaceFlinger.cpp
+++ b/services/surfaceflinger/SurfaceFlinger.cpp
@@ -7162,6 +7162,11 @@ const std::unordered_map<std::string, uint32_t>& SurfaceFlinger::getGenericLayer
             {"org.chromium.arc.V1_0.IsDialogTask", METADATA_IS_DIALOG},
             {"org.chromium.arc.V1_0.IsHome", METADATA_IS_HOME},
             {"org.chromium.arc.V1_0.NotificationKey", METADATA_NOTIFICATION_KEY},
+            // fydroid: expose the WM window type (TYPE_TOAST/IME/OVERLAY) so the
+            // composer can classify standalone (no-TaskId) layers and give them
+            // a zcr_toast_surface. WindowManager sets METADATA_WINDOW_TYPE on
+            // every window's SurfaceControl.
+            {"org.chromium.arc.V1_0.WindowType", METADATA_WINDOW_TYPE},
     };
     return genericLayerMetadataKeyMap;
 }
